; B 站 Cookie 抓取
; App 原生接口(fingerprint/myinfo/mine)通常只有 access_key，没有 SESSDATA。
; 打开「直播 / 漫画 / 我的→大会员」才会打到带网页 Cookie 的接口。
hostname = app.bilibili.com, api.bilibili.com, api.live.bilibili.com, manga.bilibili.com
^https?:\/\/app\.bilibili\.com\/x\/resource\/fingerprint url script-request-header https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/WillpowerJin/ql-scripts@main/bilibili/quantumultx/bilibili_cookie.js
^https?:\/\/app\.bilibili\.com\/x\/v2\/account\/myinfo url script-request-header https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/WillpowerJin/ql-scripts@main/bilibili/quantumultx/bilibili_cookie.js
^https?:\/\/app\.bilibili\.com\/x\/v2\/account\/mine url script-request-header https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/WillpowerJin/ql-scripts@main/bilibili/quantumultx/bilibili_cookie.js
^https?:\/\/api\.bilibili\.com\/x\/web-interface\/nav url script-request-header https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/WillpowerJin/ql-scripts@main/bilibili/quantumultx/bilibili_cookie.js
^https?:\/\/api\.live\.bilibili\.com\/xlive\/web-ucenter\/ url script-request-header https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/WillpowerJin/ql-scripts@main/bilibili/quantumultx/bilibili_cookie.js
^https?:\/\/manga\.bilibili\.com\/twirp\/ url script-request-header https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/WillpowerJin/ql-scripts@main/bilibili/quantumultx/bilibili_cookie.js
